// 003-failures.md: schema-error fields emit computed proto keys
// rule: docs/design/src/003-failures.md#c89de8e6573d2c67
// 003-failures.md: identifier, quoted, escaped and nested schema-error proto fields remain own validated data
// rule: docs/design/src/003-failures.md#08840bab72cb7e54
// 006-data.md: missing and invalid proto values fail; string own fields decode
